; 01-stale-site-math: an error made right after a library function returns (the unbound after, bound on every call of w1 but the last) says it was at the last call the function's code made: its Site, which a native way must leave too, for each way its code goes, after 4 calls at the same place
(fun {w1 f x n} {do (if (zero? n) NIL (set {after} n)) (f x) after (w1 f x (- n 1))})
(fun {w2 f x y n} {do (if (zero? n) NIL (set {after} n)) (f x y) after (w2 f x y (- n 1))})
